{"title": "Dash", "pageid": 1149, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dash", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Common actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dash.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Dash.webp/300px-Dash.webp, /w/images/4/41/Dash.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Dash.webp/300px-Dash.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Dash.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Dash</b> is a basic, common action available to almost every creature. It doubles the movement speed of a creature for one turn.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nCover more distance this turn: double your <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Dash</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Dash_NPC</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash_NPC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash_NPC\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Dash_HookHorror</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash_HookHorror\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash_HookHorror\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreSilence_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreSilence (spell flag)\">IgnoreSilence</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=NoCameraMove_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NoCameraMove (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">NoCameraMove</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Stealth (spell flag)\">Stealth</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Dash\"> Condition: Dash </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\">Dash</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is doubled.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stacking_dashes\">Stacking dashes</span></h3>\n<p>Dashing multiple times in a turn is possible with additional actions from features like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Action_Surge\" title=\"Action Surge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/20px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/30px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/40px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action Surge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/20px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Action_Surge\" title=\"Action Surge\">Action Surge</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> or by using bonus action dashes like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Dash\" title=\"Cunning Action: Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cunning Action: Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Dash\" title=\"Cunning Action: Dash\">Cunning Action: Dash</a>. When dashing multiple times, the movement bonus from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\">Dash</a> stacks by <em>addition</em> rather than multiplication. For example, a character with 9 m (30 ft) movement speed who dashes twice gets 9 m (30 ft) bonus movement speed added twice for a total of 27 m (90 ft) (a 3x multiplier) rather than doubling the movement speed twice (which would be a 4x multiplier). Similarly, dashing three times applies a movement speed multiplier of 4x, not 8x.\n</p><p>Dashing more than three times in a turn has no effect; subsequent dashes simply do not add any additional movement speed.<sup id=\"cite_ref-stack_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-stack-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The special dash-like action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Click_Heels\" title=\"Click Heels\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Click Heels\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Click_Heels\" title=\"Click Heels\">Click Heels</a> <em>does</em> stack multiplicatively with normal dashes. That is, dashing and using Click Heels doubles movement speed, and then doubles it again for a 4x multiplier. Dashing three times and using Click heels increases movement speed by 8x. The order of the dashes and Click Heels does not matter and the total movement speed increase is the same.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dash_variants\">Dash variants</span></h2>\n<p>Aside from the base Dash action available to every creature, there are a number of special, cheaper dash actions available to certain classes or under certain conditions.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Click_Heels\" title=\"Click Heels\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Click Heels\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Click_Heels\" title=\"Click Heels\">Click Heels</a> – Dash-like bonus action granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Speed\" title=\"Boots of Speed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Boots_of_Speed_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Speed\" title=\"Boots of Speed\">Boots of Speed</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Dash\" title=\"Cunning Action: Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cunning Action: Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Dash\" title=\"Cunning Action: Dash\">Cunning Action: Dash</a> – Bonus action dash available to <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue\" title=\"Rogue\">rogues</a> at level 2.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(bonus_action)\" title=\"Dash (bonus action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash (bonus action)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(bonus_action)\" title=\"Dash (bonus action)\">Dash (bonus action)</a> – Bonus action dash from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Expeditious_Retreat\" title=\"Expeditious Retreat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/20px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/30px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/40px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Expeditious Retreat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/20px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Expeditious_Retreat\" title=\"Expeditious Retreat\">Expeditious Retreat</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage:_Eagle_Heart\" title=\"Rage: Eagle Heart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/20px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/40px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage: Eagle Heart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/20px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage:_Eagle_Heart\" title=\"Rage: Eagle Heart\">Rage: Eagle Heart</a>. Note that even though the initial cast of Expeditious Retreat grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\">Dash</a>, it does not count as a dash action for certain interactions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind:_Dash\" title=\"Step of the Wind: Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Step of the Wind: Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind:_Dash\" title=\"Step of the Wind: Dash\">Step of the Wind: Dash</a> – Bonus action dash available to <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">monks</a> at level 2. This action also requires a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/30px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/40px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Point\" title=\"Ki Point\">Ki Point</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_items\">Related items</span></h2>\n<p>The following items trigger an effect when using Dash:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Arcane_Bolstering\" title=\"Boots of Arcane Bolstering\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Boots_of_Arcane_Bolstering_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Boots_of_Arcane_Bolstering_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Boots_of_Arcane_Bolstering_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Boots_of_Arcane_Bolstering_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Boots_of_Arcane_Bolstering_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Boots_of_Arcane_Bolstering_Unfaded_Icon.png.