/1a/The_Speedy_Lightfeet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Speedy_Lightfeet\" title=\"The Speedy Lightfeet\">The Speedy Lightfeet</a> – Grants three <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a></li></ul>\n<p>These items also trigger when using any of the dash variants. Other movement actions such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charger\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Charger_Weapon_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\">Charger</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Primal_Stampede\" title=\"Primal Stampede\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp/20px-Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp/30px-Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp/40px-Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Primal Stampede\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp/20px-Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Primal_Stampede_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Primal_Stampede\" title=\"Primal Stampede\">Primal Stampede</a> do not count as dashes for these items.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_features\">Related features</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Beast:_Stallion\" title=\"Aspect of the Beast: Stallion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp/25px-Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp/38px-Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp/50px-Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Beast: Stallion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp/25px-Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Aspect_of_the_Beast_Stallion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Beast:_Stallion\" title=\"Aspect of the Beast: Stallion\">Aspect of the Beast: Stallion</a> – Receive temporary hit points with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\">Dash</a> condition. Note that Aspect of the Beast (Stallion) does not work with Click Heels, which grants a distinct condition (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Click_Heels_(Condition)\" title=\"Click Heels (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Click Heels\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Click_Heels_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Click_Heels_(Condition)\" title=\"Click Heels (Condition)\">Click Heels</a>), nor does it work with stacked dashes since they are separate, but identically named, conditions.<sup id=\"cite_ref-stack_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-stack-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Shot\" title=\"Mobile Shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Shot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Mobile_Shot_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Shot\" title=\"Mobile Shot\">Mobile Shot</a> – Requires the Dash condition (or the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disengage_(Condition)\" title=\"Disengage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage_(Condition)\" title=\"Disengage (Condition)\">Disengage</a> condition) in order to use the attack. It also only works with a single dash and not stacked dashes.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_sources_of_movement_speed\" title=\"List of sources of movement speed\">List of sources of movement speed</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-stack-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-stack_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_